{"sourceUrl":"https://cse.sysu.edu.cn/article/3244","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:14.814161+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cse.sysu.edu.cn/article/3244","html":"<div><p> </p><p><span><span>中山大学计算机学院位于广州校区东校园（广州大学城），前身是</span><span>1979</span><span>年教育部批复设立的计算机科学系。学院践行“理工结合、学科交叉”，重点发展高性能计算与体系结构、人工智能与机器人、云计算与</span></span><span><span>边缘计算、网络与信息安全、量子计算与新型计算、科学与工程计算等研究方向。</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院夏令营活动旨在搭建学院与学生交流互动平台，使学生充分了解中山大学、计算机学院，与学院的科研团队进行交流，开展初步的科研实践训练。</span><span></span></span></p><p> </p><p><span><span><strong>一、招收对象及条件</strong></span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>面向全国范围内</span><span>2026</span><span>届优秀本科毕业生（目前为三年级本科生、预期能获得推免资格），对科学研究有浓厚兴趣，有较强的研究、创新能力及培养潜质。<strong>特别欢迎有直博意向的学生申请。</strong>报名的基本条件：</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录；</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>、具有良好英语听、说、读、写及应用能力。</span><span></span></span></p><p> </p><p><span><span><strong>二、报名方式及遴选方法</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>1</strong></span><span><strong>、申请人需提交的材料内容：</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>）个人简历；</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>）本科阶段包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（须加盖教务处或院系公章）；</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>）本科阶段同年级专业前两年半总成绩排名证明</span><span>1</span><span>份（原件），须加盖有教务部门或院系公章；</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>）体现自身英语水平的证明（官方认证的纸质成绩单）复印件</span><span>1</span><span>份；</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span><span>）计算机或相关学科领域副教授或教授推荐信</span><span>2</span><span>份（正文内容可电脑录入或手写，打印后专家亲笔签字，本计算机学院学生不用提交），推荐信模版见附件。</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span><span>）其他证明材料（如获奖证书复印件；发表文章或研究成果证明材料复印件。已发表文章只需提供文章首页打印件等）。</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><u>【说明】以上</u></span><span><u>1</u></span><span><u>）</u></span><span><u>-4</u></span><span><u>）为必须项，第</u></span><span><u>5</u></span><span><u>）项为直博意向申请人必须项，第</u></span><span><u>6</u></span><span><u>）项根</u></span></span><span><span><u>据自身实际情况提交。</u></span><span><u></u></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>2</strong></span><span><strong>、材料提交方式及要求</strong></span></span><span><span><strong><u></u></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>）所有材料即日起至</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>6</span><span>日</span><span>00:00</span><span>前提交电子版到</span></span><span><span>中山大学研究生招生平台（</span></span><a href=\"https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/</span></a><span><span>），勿需提交纸质版。</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>）申请者应保证提交的所有电子信息的真实性。如因不实信息或者伪造材料所造成的后果由本人承担。</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>3</strong></span><span><strong>、营员遴选</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>）硕士意向营员：学院组织专家组对报名材料进行综合评审择优筛选入营。</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>）直博意向营员：经意向导师推荐，学院组织专家组审核后入营。</span><span></span></span></p><p> </p><p><span><span><strong>三、活动时间及内容</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、线上宣讲会（面向所有营员）：</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span><span>-</span></span><span><span>9</span><span>日，介绍学校学院情况、科研平台与科研团队、研究生招生情况等。</span><span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://cse.sysu.edu.cn/article/3244\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>2</span></span></a><span><span>、暑期实习活动（面向直博意向营员）：</span><span>7</span><span>月中下旬，进入意向导师的实验室进行实践实习，为期约</span><span>2</span><span>周，具体形式和内容由意向导师安排确定。</span><span></span></span></p><p> </p><p><span><span><strong>四、其他说明</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、学院的研究生导师信息参见学院网站：</span></span><a href=\"https://cse.sysu.edu.cn/teacher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://cse.sysu.edu.cn/teacher</span></a><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、活动联系人：李老师</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span><span>020-39943150</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:limei22@mail.sysu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>limei22@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></a><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>联系地址：广州市番禺区大学城外环东路</span><span>132</span><span>号中山大学计算机学院</span><span>A107</span><span>办公室，邮编</span><span>510006</span><span>。</span><span></span></span></p><p> </p><p><span><span>中山大学计算机学院    </span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日     </span></span><span><span></span></span></p></div>","textSha256":"798d998b479b8ddb4be2f8339f1631bbd4137189bc97b6f187cd6a1ea1066454","textLength":1209,"sourceSha256":"6451647b2afa5251b60f50b018863744e832cb87b290d9e0fbd95aaf2b4ed24b","selector":".field-body","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-733e46b800dca0a35b0d","title":"2025年中山大学计算机学院2025年优秀大学生夏令营及直博意向生夏令营活动报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:14.814161+00:00"}
